  "htmlPage": {
    "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/records/actions/search/"
  },
  "rulesText": "When you take the Search action, you make a Wisdom check to discern something that isn't obvious. The Search table suggests which skills are applicable when you take this action, depending on what you're trying to detect.\n\nSearch\n\n| Skill      | Thing to Detect                      |\n| :--------- | :----------------------------------- |\n| Insight    | Creature’s state of mind             |\n| Medicine   | Creature’s ailment or cause of death |\n| Perception | Concealed creature or object         |\n| Survival   | Tracks or food                       |"
}
